developer_guide.pdf
schema_summary.md
schema_summary.pdf

# Per-developer Claude Code settings: permission allowlists and local
# overrides, personal to whoever is working in the checkout. Tracked by
# accident since the initial commit; untracked here so one person's
# allowlist is no longer pushed to everyone else.
.claude/settings.local.json
